note Compose with trace.om. Emit a synthetic complete capture for golden-byte comparison.
fn main to int
if not gtinit 7 11 13 2 3 1
ret 1
end
if ne gtappend 7 17 2 224 4294967295 19 0
ret 2
end
if ne gtappend 7 17 3 224 0 23 0
ret 3
end
